## Frequently asked questions

### Do I need a separate AEO agency as well as ecommerce SEO?

Not usually. AI assistants draw on the same product pages, feeds, reviews and third-party sources that search engines use. Good ecommerce SEO covers most of that groundwork. A separate AI visibility audit is worth it when you need a measured baseline. It shows how often assistants mention, cite or recommend your store and which sources they rely on.

My guide to the [best AEO agencies](/blog/best-aeo-agencies/) compares UK options. It includes me and carries a disclosure.

